'''Küyenmapu''' ({{Langx|arn|Küyen Mapu|4=land of the moon}}) is a sparsely populated [[Indigenous nations in Balisca|indigenous territory]] and [[Regions of Balisca|region]] at the northern edge of the [[Cerdanya|Tinguiririca Peninsula]], within the [[Balisca|Baliscan Confederation]]. The region comprises the northern section of the [[Matarrañya / Cañadapirén]], along with major lakes, [[w:Fjord|fjords]], [[w:Glacier|glaciers]], [[W:Tableland|tablelands]] and [[w:Steppe|steppes]]. 

Küyenmapu is bounded by the [[Salsipuedes Sea]] on the south, the [[W:Atlantic Ocean|Atlantic Ocean]] to the east, and the {{W|Mar de Hoces}} to the southwest. 

